WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
QA observation starts on. /ernesto setup
provides the exact local command.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The explicit --init helper creates defaults and
runs one real passing test.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Expand scope and record details. A match covers
declared inputs at comparison time.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Editing a declared source input makes the
previous passing result stale.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
A second explicit run really fails. Ernesto
preserves that failure.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
/ernesto quiet on hides the banter while
preserving the evidence and controls.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Restore banter and offer chocolate. The failed
result stays failed.
